  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A car of total mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> is travelling with a constant speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. Each of the four wheels of the car has a mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and a radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> and rolls without slipping.</p>\n<p>The moment of inertia of each wheel is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I=\\frac{1}{2}mR^{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{sum of the rotational kinetic energy of all four wheels}}{\\textit{translational kinetic energy of the car}}\"></span>?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m}{2M}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m}{M}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2m}{M}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4m}{M}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
